 **Data Structures:**
-- Accumulated color $C_{acc}$ (initialized to 0 or background color).
-- Accumulated opacity $\alpha_{acc}$ (initialized to 0).
-- Previous sample color $C_{prev}$ (initialized to background or first sample).
